tualization Framework,developer tools,CLI tooling,open source\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://vibebox.robcholz.com\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"VibeBox\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Your ultrafast open source AI sandbox.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://vibebox.robcholz.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"VibeBox\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://vibebox.robcholz.com/icon.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"512\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"512\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"VibeBox\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"VibeBox\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Your ultrafast open source AI sandbox.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://vibebox.robcholz.com/icon.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"space_grotesk_4897f224-module__njNxqq__variable jetbrains_mono_3c1efa34-module__nJYzFa__variable font-display\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><header class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6 px-6 pb-10 pt-12 text-center\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><h1 class=\"text-shadow text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ember-200 sm:text-5xl\">Run agents, commands, and patches safely inside a lightning-fast VM.</h1><p class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl text-base text-ember-200 sm:text-lg\">VibeBox is a lightweight, ultra-fast sandbox for AI agents. It runs on Apple&#x27;s Virtualization Framework so your real system stays safe while the agent works.</p></div></header><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl text-left\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-ember-400\">Quickstart</p><div class=\"mt-3 rounded-2xl bg-coal-400/80 p-3 text-center\"><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-dot\"></span><span class=\"code-dot\"></span><span class=\"code-dot\"></span></div><div class=\"code-content\"><div class=\"code-line comment\"># Works everywhere. Installs everything.</div><div class=\"code-line cmd\"><span class=\"code-prompt\">$</span><span class=\"os-cmd\">curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/robcholz/vibebox/main/install | bash</span><button class=\"copy-line-btn \" data-cmd=\"oneliner\" title=\"Copy\"><span class=\"copy-icon\">\u29c9</span></button></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-16 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold text-ember-200\">What It Does</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm text-ember-200\">Six core capabilities that make Vibebox fast, safe, and developer-first.</p><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-ember-700/50 p-6 shadow-card backdrop-blur bg-coal-300/80 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-ember-500/70 hover:shadow-glow\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-2 grid place-items-center rounded-none border-0\"><img src=\"/rotate-ccw.svg\" alt=\"Warm starts under 6 seconds\" class=\"h-10 w-10 opacity-90 invert\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ember-100\">Warm starts under 6 seconds</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ember-300/80\">Cached base images make re-entry nearly instant.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-ember-700/50 p-6 shadow-card backdrop-blur bg-coal-300/80 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-ember-500/70 hover:shadow-glow\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-2 grid place-items-center rounded-none border-0\"><img src=\"/terminal.svg\" alt=\"Full command freedom\" class=\"h-10 w-10 opacity-90 invert\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ember-100\">Full command freedom</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ember-300/80\">Agents can run tasks and patch files inside the VM.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-ember-700/50 p-6 shadow-card backdrop-blur bg-coal-300/80 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-ember-500/70 hover:shadow-glow\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-2 grid place-items-center rounded-none border-0\"><img src=\"/shield-check.svg\" alt=\"Isolated by design\" class=\"h-10 w-10 opacity-90 invert\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ember-100\">Isolated by design</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ember-300/80\">Apple Virtualization keeps the host sealed off.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-ember-700/50 p-6 shadow-card backdrop-blur bg-coal-300/80 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-ember-500/70 hover:shadow-glow\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-2 grid place-items-center rounded-none border-0\"><img src=\"/sliders-horizontal.svg\" alt=\"Predictable resources\" class=\"h-10 w-10 opacity-90 invert\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ember-100\">Predictable resources</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ember-300/80\">Set CPU, RAM, disk size, and mounts in vibebox.toml.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-ember-700/50 p-6 shadow-card backdrop-blur bg-coal-300/80 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-ember-500/70 hover:shadow-glow\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-2 grid place-items-center rounded-none border-0\"><img src=\"/scroll-text.svg\" alt=\"Auditable sessions\" class=\"h-10 w-10 opacity-90 invert\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ember-100\">Auditable sessions</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ember-300/80\">Project state lives in .vibebox with logs and keys.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-ember-700/50 p-6 shadow-card backdrop-blur bg-coal-300/80 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-ember-500/70 hover:shadow-glow\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-2 grid place-items-center rounded-none border-0\"><img src=\"/smile-plus.svg\" alt=\"Supereasy\" class=\"h-10 w-10 opacity-90 invert\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ember-100\">Supereasy</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ember-300/80\">One command drops you into a ready sandbox.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-20 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold text-ember-200\">Featured In</h2><div class=\"mt-8 flex justify-center\"><a class=\"w-full max-w-sm\" href=\"https://github.com/robcholz/vibebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-ember-700/50 p-6 shadow-card backdrop-blur bg-coal-300/80 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-ember-500/70 hover:shadow-glow\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-2 grid place-items-center rounded-none border-0\"><img src=\"/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\" class=\"h-10 w-10 opacity-90 invert\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ember-100\">GitHub</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ember-300/80\">View the source.</p></div></div></a></div></section><footer class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-center gap-2 px-6 pb-10 text-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-ember-200\"><a class=\"text-base text-ember-200 transition hover:text-ember-100\" href=\"https://github.com/robcholz/vibebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">VibeBox</a><span class=\"text-sm text-ember-400\">by<!-- --> <a class=\"text-ember-300 transition hover:text-ember-100\" href=\"https://www.robcholz.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Finn Sheng</a> <!-- -->&amp; community.</span></div></footer></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></tem